    "body": "[ced](https://github.com/google/compact_enc_det/blob/2f40a850bcc5d6f7c1bfa02dbf42ad19d8220dc0/compact_enc_det/compact_enc_det_generated_tables.h#L517-L518) doesn't have windows-1254 higher than windows-1252 for the .az TLD, but it's unclear how self-referential those statistics are. That is, could the windows-1252 result arise from ced not having been well trained on Azeri?\r\n\r\nmacOS doesn't support setting Azeri as the primary language, so what Safari does at this time is moot.",
