    "body": "So I generally support improving Azeri support. As for the particulars of what it would take to change ced to accomplish this, I'm not the expert. I'll reach out to our ced experts and ask them to take a look here.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n> Search for \"Azerbaijan\" in https://hsivonen.fi/chardetng/ for the story.\r\n\r\nOr, if you're on a browser that supports scroll-to-text-fragment, just [click here](https://hsivonen.fi/chardetng/#:~:text=Notably%2C%20the%20usage%20in%20Azerbaijan%20was%20unusually%20high).",
