    "body": "> So I generally support improving Azeri support. As for the particulars of what it would take to change ced to accomplish this, I'm not the expert. I'll reach out to our ced experts and ask them to take a look here.\r\n\r\nI finally reached some folks who are familiar with `ced`. This does indeed seem to be a relatively trivial change, as expected. I'm not sure why I didn't say this originally, but: I support this change to the spec. It makes sense and should be straightforward to implement. If you wouldn't mind, can you please file a Chromium bug for this?",
